WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.297 --> 00:00:02.488
(gasping)

00:00:02.488 --> 00:00:03.321
- What?

00:00:09.704 --> 00:00:10.596
- What's up guys.

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:12.054
My name's Chris and I'm a video producer,

00:00:12.054 --> 00:00:13.121
out here in New York.

00:00:13.121 --> 00:00:14.648
Today, I'm going to find my co-workers

00:00:14.648 --> 00:00:15.648
some pizza for lunch.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:17.302
But we're not talking about regular pizza.

00:00:17.302 --> 00:00:18.806
We're not talking about
your boring toppings,

00:00:18.806 --> 00:00:21.120
like pepperoni and mushroom
and all that lame shit.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.532
We're actually looking for a pizza,

00:00:22.532 --> 00:00:24.422
that has smaller pizzas on top of it.

00:00:24.422 --> 00:00:25.799
Pizza topped with pizza,

00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:26.632
which is insane.

00:00:26.632 --> 00:00:27.693
"Chris, where in the sweet hell

00:00:27.693 --> 00:00:29.190
are you going to find
something like that?"

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:33.107
We're heading to Vinnie's
Pizzeria in Brooklyn.

00:00:36.943 --> 00:00:39.472
Ladies and gentlement...

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:40.472
We found it.

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:51.382
It is in the oven right now,

00:00:51.382 --> 00:00:52.834
and I can't wait to see this.

00:00:52.834 --> 00:00:55.098
Alright guys, we've got
the goods right there.

00:00:55.098 --> 00:00:57.598
Let's head back to the office.

00:00:58.634 --> 00:00:59.908
- Pizza is amazing.

00:00:59.908 --> 00:01:01.645
- Pizza is so fucking good.

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:03.452
- It's just like my go-to.

00:01:03.452 --> 00:01:04.670
- I feel like I get a lotta shit,

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:06.894
because I like mushrooms on my pizza.

00:01:06.894 --> 00:01:09.235
See, case in point.
- That's disgusting.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:13.554
- I do like toppings, when
someone else is paying.

00:01:13.554 --> 00:01:15.191
- I feel like it's going to be

00:01:15.191 --> 00:01:17.512
something that is a weird topping.

00:01:17.512 --> 00:01:18.373
- I'm so nervous.

00:01:18.373 --> 00:01:19.911
I don't know what this is gonna be.

00:01:19.911 --> 00:01:21.775
- I'm pretty sure you're
going to give us a pizza,

00:01:21.775 --> 00:01:23.957
with like a shoe,

00:01:23.957 --> 00:01:25.457
and like a pickle.

00:01:27.806 --> 00:01:28.639
- Aww.

00:01:28.639 --> 00:01:29.871
(laughing)

00:01:29.871 --> 00:01:30.854
- Wow.

00:01:30.854 --> 00:01:34.187
(Italian music playing)

00:01:37.324 --> 00:01:38.569
- Oh snap.

00:01:38.569 --> 00:01:41.280
It's pizza and its little babies.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.462
- It's little baby pizzas.

00:01:43.462 --> 00:01:44.942
Oh my gosh.

00:01:44.942 --> 00:01:46.376
- This is adorable.

00:01:46.376 --> 00:01:47.816
- I feel like this is going to taste

00:01:47.816 --> 00:01:50.318
like all my childhood dreams come true.

00:01:50.318 --> 00:01:51.206
- Do you eat the...

00:01:51.206 --> 00:01:52.187
Just all together?

00:01:52.187 --> 00:01:54.020
- You eat it together.

00:01:57.456 --> 00:01:59.018
- Oh my god.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.939
- Oh this is actually really good pizza.

00:02:00.939 --> 00:02:02.564
- It just has more of it on top.

00:02:02.564 --> 00:02:03.794
Can you...
Can I like peel it off.

00:02:03.794 --> 00:02:05.010
- Yeah I wanna peel it off.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:07.193
- You just have to use
like your whole hand.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:08.563
Like this.

00:02:08.563 --> 00:02:09.669
- I would never fold this,

00:02:09.669 --> 00:02:10.763
because it's just so beautiful.

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.288
I don't wanna, like, smush them together.

00:02:12.288 --> 00:02:13.413
- (whispers) I'm folding it.

00:02:13.413 --> 00:02:16.248
- I'm sorry to eat your sister.

00:02:16.248 --> 00:02:17.899
- I'm going to eat this
whole goddam thing.

00:02:17.899 --> 00:02:18.755
This is so good.

00:02:18.755 --> 00:02:19.671
- Oh, I'm savoring it.

00:02:19.671 --> 00:02:20.973
- Whoever came up with this,

00:02:20.973 --> 00:02:21.896
I like your mind.

00:02:21.896 --> 00:02:23.347
- If I saw it on the street,

00:02:23.347 --> 00:02:24.867
I would pick it up and eat it.

00:02:24.867 --> 00:02:27.805
- One and one thirds pizza,

00:02:27.805 --> 00:02:31.648
so it's 33% better than regular pizza.

00:02:31.648 --> 00:02:33.266
Math, it's math.

00:02:33.266 --> 00:02:34.099
(laughing)

00:02:34.099 --> 00:02:35.549
It's pizza math.

00:02:35.549 --> 00:02:38.533
- Is there more, that we can eat?

00:02:38.533 --> 00:02:39.369
Or is this it?

00:02:39.369 --> 00:02:41.232
- [Chris] This is it.
- Oh.

00:02:41.232 --> 00:02:43.949
- He hasn't even finished
this one, and wants another.

00:02:43.949 --> 00:02:45.949
You really like pizza...

